      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04cdd28b17bce4ca",
      "translationZh": "code - 669,517 个样例，涵盖 75 个子领域（执行跟踪、复杂度、调试、API 设计、数据结构选择）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
